# Trial by Lightning (battlefield.trial_by_lightning): the requirement arms. Main, a level 75 Warrior with the quest accepted but no
# Tuning Fork of Lightning: LP_Entrance: the key item check fails: no options: the default. bob, with the fork but the quest
# only available: BattlefieldQuest's check (accepted or more) fails: the default.
lists CloisterOfStorms/LP_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning accepted
bob: keyitem TuningForkOfLightning
login
trigger LP_Entrance                     # accepted, no fork: no options
bob: login
bob: trigger LP_Entrance                # the fork, available: no options
